    {
      "id": "frost_ingimund_count_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Since the move? Forty-one keels, of which nine were lost.” He says it instantly. “Why — has somebody been counting skulls at you?” He returns to the column. “Thrand has been counting skulls at people for eleven years. The trouble is that his arithmetic is sound.”"
        }
      ],
